160	0.20 & II  & 2467.2 & 508.1 & 13.54 & .324 & .0016 & 10 \\
161	0.25 & II  & 2488.1 & 513.8 & 13.41 & .342 & .0005 & 10 \\
162	0.30 & III & 2508.2 & 521.1 & 13.34 & .295 & 0     & 10 \\
163	0.50 & III & 2571.6 & 553.5 & 15.11 & .152 & 0     & 10 \\
164	\bottomrule
